---
title: Pumpkin Pizza
description: Squash or pumpkin sauce on naan with shredded Brussels sprouts, goat cheese, hazelnuts, and balsamic glaze.
source: The Runner's World Vegetarian Cookbook (annotated)
origin_title: Smoky Squash Flatbread with Balsamic Glaze
changes:
  - Renamed to Pumpkin Pizza (handwritten preference over printed title)
  - Allow canned pumpkin puree in place of frozen winter squash puree
  - Skip minced garlic when using garlic naan
  - Regular paprika acceptable instead of smoked
  - Naan not restricted to whole wheat; Trader Joe's noted as good
  - Prefer skillet (covered, medium-low, no oil) over baking all four at once
  - Assemble components first; toast one pizza at a time while eating
